sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agentic App<br/>(10 chained calls)
    participant GW as Gateway /<br/>InferencePool
    participant EPP as llm-d EPP<br/>(Endpoint Picker)
    participant IDX as KV-Cache<br/>Indexer
    participant P as Prefill Worker<br/>(compute-heavy)
    participant D as Decode Worker<br/>(memory-heavy)

    Note over A,D: Without llm-d: same system prompt<br/>reprocessed 10 times from scratch

    A->>GW: Call 1: Analyze this trade...<br/>(system prompt + user query)
    GW->>EPP: Pick endpoint
    EPP->>IDX: Hash system prompt prefix
    IDX-->>EPP: No cache hit (first call)
    EPP->>P: Prefill: process full prompt
    P->>D: Transfer KV-cache via NIXL<br/>(zero-copy GPU to GPU RDMA)
    D-->>A: Stream tokens

    Note over IDX: KV-cache indexed:<br/>prefix hash mapped to Decode Worker 1

    A->>GW: Call 2: Now check compliance...<br/>(same system prompt + new query)
    GW->>EPP: Pick endpoint
    EPP->>IDX: Hash system prompt prefix
    IDX-->>EPP: 93% match on<br/>Decode Worker 1
    EPP->>D: Route directly (skip prefill!)
    D-->>A: Stream tokens<br/>(10-30x faster TTFT)

    Note over A,D: Calls 3-10: all route to same<br/>decode worker with cached prefix reused
